  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">GALZ HBTQ 2021-2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GALZ LGBTQ 2021-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GALZ is the leading LGBTIQ organisation in Zimbabwe. Sida will provide core support to the organisation during the period October 2021-December 2024, for implementing its strategic plan, which is divided into four thematic priorities:
The five-year strategic plan of GALZ has one overall aim: &quot;A just society that promotes and protects human rights of LGBTIQ people as equal citizens in Zimbabwe. The strategy has four priority pillars:

1. Membership and Community Empowerment

2. Knowledge, Documentation and Ideas

3. Policy, Law, Human Rights and Access to Justice

4. The GALZ Home: Governance, Institutional</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">GALZ &#xe4;r den ledande HBTIQ-organisationen i Zimbabwe. Sida har i omg&#xe5;ngar finansierat insatser som genomf&#xf6;rts av GALZ - senast under perioden 2018-2021. Denna g&#xe5;ng f&#xf6;resl&#xe5;r Sida dock ett mer l&#xe5;ngsiktigt k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till organisationen f&#xf6;r perioden Oktober 2021-December 2024. HBTIQ-personer &#xe4;r fortsatt en mycket utsatt grupp i det zimbabwiska samh&#xe4;llet, d&#xe4;r homo- och transfobin &#xe4;r utbredd. Det demokratiska utrymmet f&#xf6;r civilsamh&#xe4;llesakt&#xf6;rer &#xe4;r hotat, och ett krympande antal internationella givare och oviljan bland dessa att bidra med k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d g&#xf6;r att flertalet organisationer inom det zimbabwiska civilsamh&#xe4;llet st&#xe5;r inf&#xf6;r stora utmaningar. Ytterst lite utrymme ges fr&#xe5;n givarna att ocks&#xe5; utveckla organisationernas h&#xe5;llbarhet och motst&#xe5;ndskraft. 

Organisationens nya fem&#xe5;riga strategiska plan &#xe4;r uppdelad i fyra tematiska prioriteringar:

1. St&#xe4;rka HBTIQ-r&#xf6;relsen i landet.

2. Bygga kunskap och utveckla id&#xe9;er

3. Policy, lagstiftning, m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter och tillg&#xe5;ng till r&#xe4;ttvisa

4. St&#xe4;rka GALZ som institution</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The five-year strategic plan of GALZ has one overall aim: &quot;A just society that promotes and protects human rights of LGBTIQ people as equal citizens in Zimbabwe. The strategy has four priority pillars:

1. Membership and Community Empowerment - Expected outcomes:

- An all-inclusive empowered movement

- Increase in LGBTIQ persons who demand social justice and inclusion

- Reduced gender based and sexuality related violence, stigma and discrimination of LGBTIQ persons

2. Knowledge, Documentation and Ideas

- Enabling policy and operational environment for LGBTIQ persons and organisations

- Publishing of positive media reports by journalists

- Increased number of community members sharing their stories

- Improved knowledge on gender and sexuality diversity among community members

3. Policy, Law, Human Rights and Access to Justice

- Strengthened coalitions advocating for LGBTIQ rights

- Strengthened legal strategy for LGBTIQ organisations in Zimbabwe

- Improved high level political advocacy engagements

- Strengthened partnerships with national, regional and international bodies

- Improved quality and uptake of sexual and reproductive health services and commodities by LGBTIQ persons

4. The GALZ Home: Governance, Institutional

- Improved governance and compliance to organizational policies aligned to the new strategic plan

- Increased long-term funding for the organisation</narrative>
  </description>
